<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cenbank two-week rev repo averages 18.49 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cenbank two-week rev repo averages 18.49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech central reverse repo tender on Tuesday to drain two-week funds was 18.49 percent, the CNB said.</p>
<p>Maximum accepted yield was 18.5 percent with all bids at that level accepted. Minimum accepted yield was 18.4 percent.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
